  "description": "Me propuso un año de contenido en 3 segundos",
  "body_html": "<p>¿Cómo estás?</p><p>Soy Aina y esto es Think&amp;Hack.</p><p>Esta semana te cuento cómo hice que ChatGPT leyera mi WordPress y me propusiera un calendario editorial basado en lo que ya tengo publicado.</p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>847 posts. Cero idea de qué hacer con ellos.</p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1024,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1315843,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;He conectado ChatGPT con mi WordPress&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/186168347?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"He conectado ChatGPT con mi WordPress\" title=\"He conectado ChatGPT con mi WordPress\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nM_q!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f48e43d-abb5-4c15-bc1b-3e023723220e_1024x1024.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">He conectado ChatGPT con mi WordPress</figcaption></figure></div><p>El otro día estaba mirando un proyecto abandonado. Info-playas.com. Una web de playas españolas que dejé de actualizar hace tiempo.</p><p>847 posts. Guías de playas, servicios, accesos. Contenido que en su momento funcionaba y ahora acumula polvo digital.</p><p><strong>Me hice la pregunta obvia: ¿Qué hago con esto?</strong></p><p>Y entonces me acordé de algo que escribí la semana pasada. Que el contenido no se inventa, se extrae. Que cada proyecto terminado tiene al menos cinco ángulos de contenido.</p><p>Pero 847 posts. No voy a revisarlos uno a uno.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Y ahí está el problema</h3><p>La mayoría piensa que necesita más ideas. Lo que necesita es un sistema que lea las que ya tiene.</p><p>Tenemos años de contenido acumulado y ninguna forma práctica de analizarlo. Los CMS te dicen cuántas visitas tiene cada post. No te dicen qué patrones hay entre ellos, qué temas nunca desarrollaste del todo, qué contenido podrías actualizar.</p><p><strong>Eso requiere lectura. Análisis. Tiempo que no tenemos.</strong></p><p>O una IA que pueda leerlo por ti.</p><h3>Lo que hice</h3><p>Los GPTs personalizados de ChatGPT tienen algo que mucha gente no conoce: Actions. La capacidad de conectarse con APIs externas.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s__4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3246e79e-4f7b-4510-afd7-36bf74ff00e4_959x808.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s__4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3246e79e-4f7b-4510-afd7-36bf74ff00e4_959x808.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s__4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3246e79e-4f7b-4510-afd7-36bf74ff00e4_959x808.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s__4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3246e79e-4f7b-4510-afd7-36bf74ff00e4_959x808.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s__4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F324